Republic Act No. 10121 otherwise known as the Philippine", "is_repeated_boilerplate": false}, {"line": 52, "text": "Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Act of 2010, particularly Section 2 (a), which", "is_repeated_boilerplate": false}, {"line": 53, "text": "mandates the State to “uphold the people’s Constitutional right to life and property by", "is_repeated_boilerplate": false}, {"line": 54, "text": "addressing the root causes of vulnerabilities to disasters, strengthening the country’s", "is_repeated_boilerplate": false}, {"line": 55, "text": "institutional capacity for disaster risk reduction and management and building the", "is_repeated_boilerplate": false}, {"line": 56, "text": "resilience of local communities to disasters including climate change impacts,” and in", "is_repeated_boilerplate": false}, {"line": 57, "text": "consideration of the increasing frequency, severity and unpredictability of disaster", "is_repeated_boilerplate": false}, {"line": 58, "text": "occurrences that the country has experienced for the past years, the Department hereby", "is_repeated_boilerplate": false}, {"line": 59, "text": "enjoins all local chief executives to perform the following early preparedness actions to", "is_repeated_boilerplate": false}, {"line": 60, "text": "reduce disaster risks:", "is_repeated_boilerplate": false}, {"line": 61, "text": "On Creation ofSystems and Structures:", "is_repeated_boilerplate": false}, {"line": 62, "text": "J.", "is_repeated_boilerplate": false}, {"line": 63, "text": "Issue an Executive Order establishing the Incident Command System (ICS) which", "is_repeated_boilerplate": false}, {"line": 64, "text": "is to be activated in response to disasters or emergencies, with reference to", "is_repeated_boilerplate": false}, {"line": 65, "text": "NDRRMC Memorandum Circular No.", "is_repeated_boilerplate": false}, {"line": 66, "text": "04,", "is_repeated_boilerplate": false}, {"line": 67, "text": "s. 2012!, dated March 28, 2012,", "is_repeated_boi